### 1. Pris for booking 1 fra InitData (forventet: total 120)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/price

### 2. Reserver det ledige sæde 1c som gæst med en børnebillet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seatCode": "1c",
  "userId": null,
  "guestName": "David",
  "guestMail": "Thomassen@email.dk",
  "showingId": 1
}

### Registrer en ny bruger (forventet: 201 med id, navn, email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lucas",
  "email": "lucas@mail.dk",
  "password": "hemmelig123",
  "birthday": "2000-01-01"
}

### Log ind med rigtig adgangskode (forventet: 200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas@mail.dk",
  "password": "hemmelig123"
}

### Log ind med forkert adgangskode (forventet: fejl)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas@mail.dk",
  "password": "forkert"
}

### Registrer med samme email igen (forventet: fejl)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lucas",
  "email": "lucas@mail.dk",
  "password": "noget",
  "birthday": "2000-01-01"
}
  "guestMail": "david@email.dk",
  "showingId": 1,
  "ticketTypeId": 2
}

### 3. Pris for den nye booking (forventet: total 80)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/price

### 4. Betal den
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/pay

### 5. Betal igen (forventet: fejl, fordi den allerede er betalt)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/pay
